    "detailed_description": "<strong>Overview</strong><br>This is a strategy game that involves conquering levels with a limited number of units.<br>The game has a high level of difficulty and is suitable for players who enjoy planning with limited resources, puzzle-solving, and strategy.<br><br><strong>Levels</strong><br>The world features a semi-open and free exploration mode, with each region's levels having their unique unit mechanics and rewards.<br>Each level consists of several campaigns and resources. You need to use the limited unit resources on the map to plan your route and overcome the levels.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/d4e4b9af7c9a2291dc9fed938a575aa4.avif?t=1705933597\" /></span><br><br><strong>Units</strong><br>Each unit has a unique mechanism with its own strengths and weaknesses, and mastering their use will save more resources.<br>Moreover, the units can work together cooperatively, trading a lower cost for more resources.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/d9eebf6aeab29a167f0f1677dcbc3a0a.avif?t=1705933597\" /></span><br><br><strong>Battles</strong><br>The game utilizes an action combat mechanism, with unit attacks having precise entity detection, hit stun, and knockback effects.<br>Fine-tuning positioning to change the timing of the attack is an important means of influencing the outcome of battle beyond just the mix of unit types.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/99a863ef0476c77ea93c998e6c2fc572.poster.avif?t=1705933597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/99a863ef0476c77ea93c998e6c2fc572.webm?t=1705933597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/99a863ef0476c77ea93c998e6c2fc572.mp4?t=1705933597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Rewards</strong><br>Each level has one unique piece of equipment, and unlocking new equipment and new units can be used in other levels.<br>With the right combination, they can make your battles much more efficient.<br>Some levels may also contain hidden rewards that require triggering specific conditions to obtain.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/92d6bdb693efc792c5fc7073dae4fd91.avif?t=1705933597\" /></span><br><br><strong>Challenges</strong><br>Trying to conquer more campaigns with fewer resources will earn higher scores.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/73f860b6bb69dd72a0691fd48474a8d5.avif?t=1705933597\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Overview</strong><br>This is a strategy game that involves conquering levels with a limited number of units.<br>The game has a high level of difficulty and is suitable for players who enjoy planning with limited resources, puzzle-solving, and strategy.<br><br><strong>Levels</strong><br>The world features a semi-open and free exploration mode, with each region's levels having their unique unit mechanics and rewards.<br>Each level consists of several campaigns and resources. You need to use the limited unit resources on the map to plan your route and overcome the levels.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/d4e4b9af7c9a2291dc9fed938a575aa4.avif?t=1705933597\" /></span><br><br><strong>Units</strong><br>Each unit has a unique mechanism with its own strengths and weaknesses, and mastering their use will save more resources.<br>Moreover, the units can work together cooperatively, trading a lower cost for more resources.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/d9eebf6aeab29a167f0f1677dcbc3a0a.avif?t=1705933597\" /></span><br><br><strong>Battles</strong><br>The game utilizes an action combat mechanism, with unit attacks having precise entity detection, hit stun, and knockback effects.<br>Fine-tuning positioning to change the timing of the attack is an important means of influencing the outcome of battle beyond just the mix of unit types.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/99a863ef0476c77ea93c998e6c2fc572.poster.avif?t=1705933597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271900/extras/99a863ef0476c77ea93c998e6c2fc572.webm?t=1705933597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v